WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.021
Every Money Bill deals with money.

2
00:00:02.221 --> 00:00:03.657
But not every bill about

3
00:00:03.657 --> 00:00:04.973
money is a Money Bill.

4
00:00:05.473 --> 00:00:07.131
Article 110 says a Money

5
00:00:07.131 --> 00:00:09.134
Bill contains only provisions

6
00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:09.825
on matters

7
00:00:09.925 --> 00:00:11.930
like taxes, government borrowing,

8
00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:13.509
and the Consolidated Fund.

9
00:00:13.959 --> 00:00:15.670
If there's a doubt, the Speaker's

10
00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:16.604
decision is final,

11
00:00:16.704 --> 00:00:18.129
and the Speaker's certificate

12
00:00:18.129 --> 00:00:18.965
goes on the bill.

13
00:00:19.415 --> 00:00:21.477
Under Article 109, the Rajya

14
00:00:21.477 --> 00:00:23.319
Sabha gets fourteen days.

15
00:00:23.469 --> 00:00:25.005
It can only recommend.

16
00:00:25.305 --> 00:00:26.814
The Lok Sabha may accept

17
00:00:26.814 --> 00:00:28.825
or reject those recommendations.

18
00:00:29.275 --> 00:00:31.633
A Financial Bill under Article

19
00:00:31.633 --> 00:00:33.990
117 also covers these matters,

20
00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:35.434
but not only these.

21
00:00:35.834 --> 00:00:37.450
It too needs the President's

22
00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:38.892
recommendation, and can't

23
00:00:38.892 --> 00:00:40.335
start in the Rajya Sabha.

24
00:00:40.585 --> 00:00:42.261
But after that, both Houses

25
00:00:42.261 --> 00:00:43.316
must agree to it.

26
00:00:43.816 --> 00:00:44.691
Your turn.

27
00:00:44.841 --> 00:00:46.195
What can the Rajya Sabha

28
00:00:46.195 --> 00:00:47.379
do with a Money Bill?
